Z||000006||Haze_Performance||05-24-2001||10:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DisfourDan:<BR><B>How much did those three cost (all together)? Where did you get them?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I bought it all at "Mid America Corvette".<BR>(Online)<P>I got 4 Cans of Black Color Coat<BR>      3 Cans of Clear Coat<BR>      1 Can of Flexable Bonding Clear (Used as a pre paint prep)<BR>      1 Can Plastic Prep (Cleaner)<BR>      1 Can Vinyl Prep (Cleaner)<P>It was $110.00 total (Shipping included)<P>Its very easy to use & looks great when its all dry...||||reg||14
